# Theme tokens (mandatory)

**Ant Design tokens:** [`src/styles/theme.ts`](../../src/styles/theme.ts)  
**SCSS mirror:** [`src/styles/_tokens.scss`](../../src/styles/_tokens.scss)  
**Docs:** [`docs/DESIGN.md`](../../docs/DESIGN.md)

## Required

- Colors / spacing / radius from tokens — not hardcoded hex in components.
- Change brand color: update DESIGN.md → theme.ts → _tokens.scss.

## Forbidden

- Hardcoded hex in `.tsx` files or inline `style={{ color: "#…" }}`.
- External image URLs for backgrounds (ship assets in `public/` or use gradients).
